          "The 1964 Lithuanian name calendar, reprinted by Salys in 1983, lists Nomeda with the short forms Noma and Meda on 20 January. Pakerys’s 2011 accentuation study records the stress variants Nómeda and Nomedà; both sources are linguistic records, not dates of creation."
